0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 655.5 Td (1. Turn OFF main electrical disconnect breaker and open louver door covers on rear) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 642.0 Td (cabinet.) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 622.5 Td (2. Remove filter retainer clips and pull out dusty filter mat.) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 603.0 Td (3. Wash mat in mild detergent water, dry completely with compressed air hose, or) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 589.5 Td (insert new filter mat \(Part # X100-FLT-002\).) Tj ET
0.1 0.2 0.5 rg BT /F2 14 Tf 54 570.0 Td (6. Coolant Inspection & Complete Flush Procedure) Tj ET
0.85 0.85 0.9 RG 0.75 w 54 550.0 m 558 550.0 l S
