0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 496.0 Td (2. Scrape metal chips and bio-sludge from 200L tank floor.) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 476.5 Td (3. Flush lines with 2% system cleaner solution for 1 hour, drain completely, and) Tj ET
